How many bolts do you have and how many can you fire at once?

If you bless the bolts and max out your luck (and enchant them, but
you already did that) you'll get more than 99% of them back. They do a
little bit less damage than daggers do, but it can be worth it if you
have 100s of them. It's nice to be able to break down the door to a
zoo, or fort ludios, etc. and just keep firing without having to step
in to pick up your daggers.

This usually works better with arrows as your quest artifact can give
you a large number before you enchant.

Elven rangers that can get enough elven arrows and elven bow also get
an extra shot per round.



